      {
        "id": 11471,
        "name": "BrotherDusk",
        "username": "BrotherDusk",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/brotherdusk/{size}/2246_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-01T21:06:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I prepare to go into my first few skirmish games with players brand new to the game, I thought information about the general difficulty of each character must be available somewhere.&nbsp; After all, it was in the rule book for Sentinels of the Multiverse.&nbsp; Strangely, it has been less available than I would have guessed.&nbsp; Anyone have a link to such a ranking?&nbsp; I did some cursory searches using the forum search function but wasn't able to come up with anything.</p><p>Random thoughts below:</p><p>One thing that I know makes characters instantly more accessible is the Mobility trait.</p><p>I thought Ra would be easy, but it turns out he has some of the more complex ranged and hazard attacks in the game. Needing to think about LOS, Range, and movement all at once means that player is juggling a lot of information.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:47.154Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
